labels, compute similarity matrix, and apply temperature (0.1). Total loss = criterion(logits, labels) + 0.2 * contrastive_loss. Remove auxiliary BCE loss computation. During validation and inference, only use classification head (no projection head). Keep all other training settings (batch size 16, epochs 30, patience 5, learning rate 2e-5, warmup, cosine decay, gradient clipping, mixed precision)."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
